      * Output of DISK files (RV-62): ADD, DEL and exception records
     H
     FORDHIST O          40             DISK
     FMASTER  UF         40  4AI     1 DISK                      A
     FREPORT1 O         132             PRINTER
     C                     Z-ADD5         CUSTNO  40
     C                     MOVE 'ACME'    NAME    10
     C                     Z-ADD125       AMT     72
      * Written: ORDHIST record, MASTER addition
     C                     EXCPT NEWREC
     C   01                EXCPT ADDREC
      * Delete the record read
     C           CUSTNO    CHAINMASTER               90
     C  N90                EXCPT DELREC
      * Not converted: update of the record read, a field defined later
     C                     EXCPT UPDREC
     C                     EXCPT LATE
     C                     Z-ADD1         LATEF   30
     OORDHIST E                NEWREC
     O                         CUSTNO     4
     O                         NAME      14
     O                                   20 'NEW'
     O                         AMT    B  27
     OMASTER  EADD             ADDREC
     O                         CUSTNO     4
     O                         NAME      14
     OMASTER  EDEL             DELREC
     OMASTER  E                UPDREC
     O                         NAME      14
     OORDHIST E                LATE
     O                         LATEF      3
